Test Case ID	Application and page under testing	Pre Condition	Scenario Description	Steps No	Test Steps	Expected Result
E2E_TS11_TC001	DXP -> Account Dashboard (Desktop)	"1. Account Advisor test user with exactly ONE DAF (QA7/APINT).
2. Account Dashboard deployed (Account Summary replaced).
3. DAF has balances, activity and investment allocation data.
4. Page-level failure condition available for the [Error] steps"	"Component: Dashboard Landing & Paths
(Happy Path + Negative Path)

Validate that a single-DAF Account Advisor lands directly on the NEW Account Dashboard, that the page structure, header CTAs and global navigation work, and that a page-level failure shows the error state and recovers on refresh."	Step 1	Launch the DXP QA7/APINT portal URL.	Vanguard Charitable login page loads successfully.
				Step 2	Log in with valid single-DAF Account Advisor credentials.	User is NOT routed to Account Selection; lands directly on the Account Dashboard.
				Step 3	Verify top navigation and utility header.	ACCOUNT DASHBOARD tab present and active; no ACCOUNT SUMMARY tab; header shows Need Assistance?, account switcher '<Account No> - <Fund Name>', bell and profile icon.
				Step 4	Verify page header.	Breadcrumb 'Home / Account Dashboard'; greeting 'Hello <Title> <First> <Last>'; account dropdown shows the logged-in DAF; GIVE TO CHARITIES and MAKE A CONTRIBUTION displayed.
				Step 5	Verify all modules render in Figma order with no error state.	Overview, Complete Your Setup, Manage Your Account, 4 activity cards, Balance Over Time, Investment Allocation, MyStyle carousel and footer displayed; no red banner or module warning.
				Step 6	Click GIVE TO CHARITIES, verify, then return via ACCOUNT DASHBOARD tab.	Grant recommendation page opens for the current DAF; dashboard reloads.
				Step 7	Click MAKE A CONTRIBUTION, verify, then return.	Make a contribution page opens for the current DAF; dashboard reloads.
				Step 8	Click each top nav tab (GRANTS, CONTRIBUTIONS, INVESTMENTS, MY ACCOUNT, MYGIVING), returning via ACCOUNT DASHBOARD each time.	Each tab opens its correct page (GRANTS shows the correct Grants page); ACCOUNT DASHBOARD returns to the dashboard.
				Step 9	Click breadcrumb 'Home' and sample footer links (Contact Us, FAQs, Privacy Policy).	Each navigates to the expected page.
				Step 10	[Error] Reload the dashboard with the page-level failure condition active.	Red banner 'Something went wrong while loading this page. Please refresh the page or try again later.'; balances 'No data available'; cards, BOT and IA show the unavailable message; top nav and header switcher still work.
				Step 11	[Recovery] Restore the service and refresh.	Dashboard loads normally with no error state.
