E2E_TS11_TC003	DXP -> Account Dashboard (Desktop)	"1. Account Advisor (Alpha) test user with exactly ONE DAF before the run, eligible to open an account (each run creates a DAF - use a fresh single-DAF user per run, otherwise login lands on Account Selection), with phone/email/primary address on profile.
2. Run on QA7 (creates a new DAF)."	"Component: Open Another Account
(Happy Path)

Validate the Open Another Account flow end-to-end: entry modal from both entry points, pre-filled account information wizard with multiple addresses, account creation, Contribute Later, and return to the dashboard via View Account."	Step 1	Launch the DXP QA7/APINT portal URL.	Vanguard Charitable login page loads successfully.
				Step 2	Log in with valid Account Advisor credentials.	User is authenticated and lands on the Account Dashboard (ACCOUNT DASHBOARD tab active).
				Step 3	Click 'Open Another Account' in Manage Your Account; click Cancel; reopen and click X.	Modal 'We'll use your profile to set up your account' opens with body text, CONTINUE, Cancel and X; Cancel and X both close it with no navigation.
				Step 4	Open the account dropdown and click 'Open Additional Account'.	Same entry modal opens.
				Step 5	Click CONTINUE.	/open-an-additional-account/account-information/ loads; Step 1 'Provide account information' active; Steps 2 'Legacy options' and 3 'Review and Submit' listed; Primary Advisor tab shown.
				Step 6	Verify pre-filled profile data.	Title, First/Last Name, DOB, Gender and masked SSN last-4 pre-filled and read-only; phone, email and primary address pre-filled.
				Step 7	Add a Home address (fill required fields); add a Mailing address and Remove it.	New block shows Address Type, Primary Address radio and Remove link; only one Primary allowed; Remove deletes the block; Add Address disabled until required fields filled.
				Step 8	Verify Preferred Delivery Method and second advisor section.	Electronic delivery (suggested) selected by default with 'View additional information'; Paper and U.S. mail with email notification options; 'Add secondary advisor', EXIT, CLEAR, NEXT displayed.
				Step 9	Click NEXT, complete Legacy options with defaults, review and submit.	Account Created page (/confirm/): 'Success! You have created an additional account.', new Account No and Name, CONTRIBUTE LATER and CONTRIBUTE NOW; top nav shows ACCOUNT DASHBOARD.
				Step 10	Capture the new Account No and click CONTRIBUTE LATER.	Contribute to account later' page with Steps 1-3, FAQs link, 'Estimated Initial Contribution (Optional)' dropdown, VIEW ACCOUNT; top nav shows ACCOUNT DASHBOARD.
				Step 11	Click VIEW ACCOUNT.	User returns to the Account Dashboard; the new account appears in the DAF dropdown.
